  (text "Notes related to TP4054-42-SOT25-R:\nIt's recommended VCC range is: (4.0-9.0)V\nFor the Programming Charge Current I(Bat) \nthere are two equations:\nWhen I(Bat)≤0.15A, then:\nI(Bat) = 1000/Rprog = 100mA\nWhen I(Bat)>0.15A, then: \nRprog = 1000/I(Bat)*(1.2-4/3*I(Bat))"
    (at 27.94 396.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 955cbad2-2551-414f-b63c-0e6a28928738)
